{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vextorial</strong> is a Multi-Dimensional puzzle-platformer where you play as Pilo, a 2D creature exploring a 3D space. Solve unique mind-bending puzzles by shifting gravity around you to explore an ancient ruin and uncover the mystery of your lost memories. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/Team_Gather.png?t=1744387371\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Throughout the adventure you will:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate GRAVITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/gifgameplay-1-gif.gif?t=1744387371\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate across planes of a 3D cube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/Shorter_Cool_gif.gif?t=1744387371\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve Meta-Puzzles in hub areas to progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/gifgameplay-5-gif.gif?t=1744387371\" /> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the lore of the enigmatic realm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/gifgameplay-2-gif.gif?t=1744387371\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>DISCORD Community Server</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get our custom emojis on Discord!\u00a0<strong>Link o